Subject: [PATCH 105/190] v4l: xilinx: vpss-scaler: Remove unused macros

commit 9528e6e015a35765a86d2a79de9e0431d1dd5293 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Remove macros that are no longer used in the driver.

Correct the vertical taps macro name in the device tree parsing
from XV_HSCALER_TAPS_2 to XV_VSCALER_TAPS_2.

Signed-off-by: Asif Ikbal <asif.ikbal@amd.com>
Message-ID: <1758003942-3610046-3-git-send-email-asif.ikbal@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
